# Only the public website is tracked in this repo.
# Everything else (strategy docs, PDFs, design references, personal photos) stays local.
# Exception: CLAUDE.md and .claude/ are operating config for Claude Code itself,
# not project content — they need to persist in git so future sessions inherit them.
# Exception: resources/ holds public downloadable assets meant to be served by the
# site itself (lead magnets, etc.) — deliberately public, unlike content-vault below.
#
# content-vault/ (the internal production system for Beyond the Pitch content —
# scripts, storyboards, source calendar/playbook) deliberately does NOT live here.
# It's tracked on the separate `content-vault` git branch instead, so it persists
# for future sessions without being served publicly by GitHub Pages off master.
*
!*.html
!assets/
!assets/*.png
!.gitignore
!CNAME
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!resources/
!resources/**
